Subject: [PATCH 04/18] Stringify macro arguments with their spacing

#x now keeps the spaces the argument was written with, including trailing
ones, the way DreamMaker does ("U(a || 1)", not "U ( a || 1 )").

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
